---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-16 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-24">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-24 top-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 bottom-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-moon-600/20 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="container-moon relative grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Novela de fantasía · En desarrollo</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-semibold text-moon-50 sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
        The Cat and the<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-soft via-white to-moon-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Silver Moon
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 font-display text-xl text-moon-200 sm:text-2xl">
        Volumen I: Un mundo nuevo
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-silver-300 sm:text-lg">
        ¿Qué sucedería si despertaras en un mundo extraordinario, lleno de magia y posibilidades,
        y descubrieras que tu conexión con él es mucho más profunda de lo que jamás imaginaste?
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a href="#trailer" class="btn-primary">
          Ver tráiler
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6.5 4.5v11l9-5.5-9-5.5z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn-secondary">Quiero enterarme del lanzamiento</a>
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-10 grid max-w-md grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-center sm:text-left">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-silver-400">Estado</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-semibold text-moon-100">Próximamente</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-silver-400">Autor</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-semibold text-moon-100">Nahum F.G.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-silver-400">Mundo</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-semibold text-moon-100">Triria</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 relative mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
      <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/20 via-transparent to-moon-500/20 blur-2xl"></div>
      <figure class="card-glass relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-glow-lg">
        <img
          src={`${base}images/poster.jpg`}
          alt="Arte promocional de The Cat and the Silver Moon"
          class="aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover"
          width="720"
          height="960"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-night-950 via-night-950/80 to-transparent p-5 pt-16">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Próximamente · Espéralo</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-display text-lg text-moon-50">Volumen I</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
